					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "CIRCLE PATTERN\nThe Circle Pattern node generates a collection of Float 2 values. When these values are used as X\/Y coordinates for shapes, textures, slices or meshes, they will form a circle.\n\nThe points paramater will set the amount of points in the pattern.\nThe radius parameter will set the radius of the pattern.\nThe Angle wild fold\/unfold the pattern.\n\nNote that the points inlet requires a cord at attribute flow."
					}
				},
