						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: POLYGON\n\nIn this example we're using the points from the Circle Pattern node to create a Polygon.\nBy changing the amount of points, you can changes the type of n-gon you get.\nWith this method you can get your freak on with hexadecagon's , tetracontagon's and enneacontagon's!"
